🔷 Return Value Kya Hota Hai?

Jab koi method apna kaam karke kuch value wapas bhejta hai, usse return value kehte hain.

👉 Matlab:
Method andar calculation karega
Phir result ko return keyword se bahar bhej dega

🧠 Basic Structure
returnType methodName(parameters) {
    // logic
    return value;
}

⚠️ Rule:

Agar method kuch return karta hai → void nahi likhenge

Jo type return kar rahe ho → wahi returnType hoga

🔹 Example 1: Simple Sum
public class Demo {

    public static int sum(int a, int b) {
        return a + b;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int result = sum(5, 3);

        System.out.println(result);
    }
}
🔎 Flow:

sum(5,3) call hua

Andar 5 + 3 = 8

return 8;

8 result me store ho gaya

🔹 Example 2: Boolean Return
public static boolean isEven(int n) {
    if(n % 2 == 0)
        return true;
    else
        return false;
}

Call:

System.out.println(isEven(4));  // true
🔹 Example 3: Return Without Storing

Tum directly bhi use kar sakte ho:

System.out.println(sum(10, 20));
🔴 Important Rule
1️⃣ void method kuch return nahi karta
public static void greet() {
    System.out.println("Hello");
}

Yeh sirf print karega, value wapas nahi bhejega.

2️⃣ Agar returnType likh diya to return zaroor karna padega

